[+++]: Switch to passthrough mode in AT command mode
[exit]: Switch to AT mode in passthrough mode
[ping]: Send an ICMP packet,ping <ipv6> [len]
[param]: read wi-sun parameters
[clear]: Restore to factory settings
[save]: Save the parameter to flash
[clrst]: Restore to factory and Reboot
[svrst]: Save the parameter and Reboot
[reset]: Software Reboot
[version]: Read the software and hardware versions
[netname]: Configure and read Wi-SUN network names
[cca]: Configure and read CCA (Clear Channel Assesment) of PHY
[txpower]: Configure and read RF transmitting power
[pan]: Configure and read Wi-SUN network PanId
[mac]: Configure and read MAC address
[domain]: Configure and read wi-sun domain region 1-NA 2-JP 3-EU 7-BZ
[chrate]: Configure and read Wireless rate
[chconfig]: Read the current value for PHY settings
[ip]: read IPV6 address
[udpopts]: UDP options Configure
[udps]: UDP data transmission udps <ip> <data>
[fstat]: read fan status(the network connection status)
[role]: read fan role(router:2 border router:1)
[neighbor]: Read neighbor devices
[at_save]: Save parameters in transmission mode
[at_dest]: Configure the destination address in transmission mode